{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QuantumObservableUniverses.QouExistsAxiom4","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QuantumObservableUniverses.QouExistsAxiom4","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.CategoricalFoundations"],"declarations":2,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.exists_axiom_4_volume","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.exists_axiom_4_volume","kind":"theorem","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/qou-exists-axiom-4.lean#L67-L80","doc":"**The volume form is an epimorphism** — the \"non-degenerate epimorphism\"\nof the manuscript's Axiom 4, now stated rather than merely named.\n\nThis replaces `Nonempty (Q.exteriorSquare ⟶ (𝟙_ Q.C))`, which was true of\nevery QOU for the wrong reason: the Hom-set contains `0`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:lem:qou-exists-axiom-4","label":"lem:qou-exists-axiom-4","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/qou-exists-axiom-4.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.exists_axiom_4_volume_data","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.exists_axiom_4_volume_data","kind":"def","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/qou-exists-axiom-4.lean#L48-L65","doc":"**Axiom 4 — categorical volume constraint.**\n\nAny `QuantumObservableUniverse R` carries the `volumeIso`\nfield — an isomorphism `Λ²V ≅ 𝟙` realising the non-degenerate\nepimorphism that pins the categorical determinant.  This is\nthe categorical formulation of the `SL(2)` gauge restriction. ","signatureChunk":0}]}